# Packages that bypass MagicNet TUN and DNS capture when MAGICNET_APP_MODE=blacklist.
# One package name per line.
#
# Architecture note:
# - Domestic vs foreign traffic is decided mainly by geodata (geosite/geoip → cn-direct / proxy).
# - Do NOT try to list “all domestic apps” here; that does not scale and fights the rule-set model.
# - This file is only for: multi-VPN coexistence, and optional user opt-outs (e.g. a payment app
#   that still misbehaves even with correct CN routing).
#
# Optional shopping / local-service opt-outs (not a full domestic catalog):
com.taobao.idlefish
com.taobao.taobao
com.xunmeng.pinduoduo
com.sankuai.meituan
ctrip.android.view
com.MobileTicket

